# ANIM-PROOF: every shipped animation feature shown in the editor, one frame per feature, on committed content only
# (Characters/Mannequin: Mannequin.skmesh, its clips, Mannequin_Locomotion.danimgraph). The scene is not saved.
# Two mannequins are spawned in PawnNoController_Demo at z = -300: ProofA (x 0) plays one clip, ProofB (x 150) runs
# the locomotion graph. Both evaluate in Edit mode (Animation.UpdateAnimationInEditor, UE "Update Animation in Editor").
# Features with engine code but NO committed content that uses them (Sequence Player / Layered Blend / Apply Additive /
# Linked Anim Layer / Two Bone IK / Look At nodes, Retarget, Sequencer skeletal track, notifies, curves) and features
# with no runtime path (Blend Space 2D node, inertialization) are listed in the INVENTORY with file:line; their frame
# here is the authoring surface (the graph panel's Add commands), not an evaluated pose.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/PawnNoController_Demo.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано spawn Characters/Mannequin/Mannequin.skmesh 0,0,-300 --id 7700000000000000001
Дано set 7700000000000000001 Tag.Tag ProofA
Дано set 7700000000000000001 Animation.UpdateAnimationInEditor true
Дано spawn Characters/Mannequin/Mannequin.skmesh 150,0,-300 --id 7700000000000000002
Дано set 7700000000000000002 Tag.Tag ProofB
Дано set 7700000000000000002 Animation.UpdateAnimationInEditor true
Дано set 7700000000000000002 Animation.Graph "\"assets:Characters/Mannequin/Mannequin_Locomotion.danimgraph\""
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 75,110,0
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.15,-1
# [anim_clip] AnimationComponent.CurrentClip plays one looping clip (Animator::Play) with no graph.
Когда set 7700000000000000001 Animation.CurrentClip "\"Walk_Loop\""
Когда 40 frames render
Тогда-вид anim_clip ProofA (left) is mid-stride in the Walk_Loop clip (one knee forward, arms swinging), not the bind pose
# [anim_bs1d_idle] the graph's Locomotion state is a Blend Space 1D on Speed (cm/s): Speed 0 = Idle_Loop.
Когда lua "World.find('ProofB'):setAnimParam('Speed', 0.0)"
Когда 40 frames render
Тогда-вид anim_bs1d_idle ProofB (right) stands in Idle_Loop: feet apart, arms down
# [anim_bs1d_sprint] Speed 1000 = the Sprint_Loop sample: a long stride, torso leaning forward.
Когда lua "World.find('ProofB'):setAnimParam('Speed', 1000.0)"
Когда 40 frames render
Тогда-вид anim_bs1d_sprint ProofB sprints in place: long stride, forward lean, clearly different from anim_bs1d_idle
# [anim_state_crouch] a Bool condition fires the Locomotion -> Crouch transition (0.2 s cross-fade).
Когда lua "local b = World.find('ProofB'); b:setAnimParam('Speed', 0.0); b:setAnimParam('IsCrouched', true)"
Когда 40 frames render
Тогда-вид anim_state_crouch ProofB crouches (knees deeply bent, hips low), the Crouch state's Crouch_Idle_Loop
# [anim_state_jump] IsFalling fires Crouch -> Jump; the Jump state plays Jump_Loop.
Когда lua "World.find('ProofB'):setAnimParam('IsFalling', true)"
Когда 40 frames render
Тогда-вид anim_state_jump ProofB in the airborne Jump_Loop pose (legs tucked), not crouching
# [anim_state_back] clearing both returns to Locomotion through the IsFalling-false transition.
Когда lua "local b = World.find('ProofB'); b:setAnimParam('IsFalling', false); b:setAnimParam('IsCrouched', false)"
Когда 40 frames render
Тогда-вид anim_state_back ProofB back in the standing Idle_Loop pose
# [anim_graph_editor] the AnimGraph document: the state machine wired to Output Pose; its Add commands are the
# authoring surface of the Sequence Player, Blend Space 1D, Layered Blend Per Bone, Apply Additive, Linked Anim
# Layer, Two Bone IK and Look At nodes. Its preview must pick the graph's TargetSkeleton (Mannequin).
Когда run Open "Characters/Mannequin/Mannequin_Locomotion.danimgraph"
Когда 10 frames render
Тогда anim_graph_editor the graph document shows State Machine 'Locomotion' -> Output Pose; the preview shows the Mannequin and NO warning "which this skeleton has no animation for"
# [anim_add_nodes] each pose node kind is added from the palette (not saved: the document is closed with Discard).
Когда run Document "Mannequin_Locomotion: Add Two Bone IK"
Когда run Document "Mannequin_Locomotion: Add Look At"
Когда run Document "Mannequin_Locomotion: Add Layered Blend Per Bone"
Когда run Document "Mannequin_Locomotion: Add Apply Additive"
Когда run Document "Mannequin_Locomotion: Add Sequence Player"
Когда run Document "Mannequin_Locomotion: Add Linked Anim Layer"
Когда 10 frames render
Тогда anim_add_nodes six new nodes on the canvas (Two Bone IK, Look At, Layered Blend Per Bone, Apply Additive, Sequence Player, Linked Anim Layer), unwired
Когда run Document "Mannequin_Locomotion: Close Discard"
# [anim_clip_editor] the animation editor on one clip.
Когда run Open "Characters/Mannequin/Mannequin_Walk_Loop.anim"
Когда 10 frames render
Тогда anim_clip_editor the animation editor shows Walk_Loop: the mannequin in its preview, a timeline with the clip's length, the skeleton tree
# [anim_control_rig] the Control Rig panel on ProofA.
Когда run Entity ProofA
Когда run Panel "Open Control Rig"
Когда run "Control Rig" "Author the control rig on the selection"
Когда 10 frames render
Тогда anim_control_rig the Control Rig panel lists ProofA's controls; control shapes drawn on the mannequin in the viewport
# [anim_sequencer] a new Level Sequence opens the Sequencer.
Когда run Assets "New Level Sequence"
Когда 10 frames render
Тогда anim_sequencer the Sequencer document is open on a new Level Sequence (empty track list, time ruler)
